                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">INDOOR VENTILATION
Mechanically ventilated room, OpenFOAM 12 incompressibleFluid.
Units: METERS.

